Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:05:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Boost values for 2-step and anti-lag, and eGate rest position
 (pro-style)

During 2-step (launch) or anti-lag the boost output and closed loop target can be
fixed values instead of the boost maps; 2-step wins over anti-lag. With the engine
stopped the boost output (eGate position or solenoid) can go to a rest position.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkhsyMr5ndz2MBCxuDZhPC
