+! pro-style boost values during 2-step and anti-lag, and wastegate rest position
+	bit launchBoostOverride,"true","false";During 2-step (launch) use the launch boost values below instead of the boost maps.
+	bit antilagBoostOverride,"true","false";During anti-lag use the anti-lag boost values below instead of the boost maps.
